WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.050
Okay, be careful.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:25.780
I encountered an aradama 
while pursing the escapees

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:32.650
Juujou Hiyori and Etou Kanami,
 and suppressed it with their help.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:37.580
<i>However, I was unable to secure them,
 and they managed to get away.</i>

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.920
<i>I am very sorry.</i>

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.050
You did well enough in 
ascertaining their location.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.040
You can come back.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.850
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:54.370
If only we had permission to attack.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.870
It's been 30 hours since 
the incident occurred.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.440
Currently, a gag order is being 
imposed regarding this incident.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:04.580
We have investigated the other Toji 
that participated in the final match.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:07.200
However, it appears that 
they carried out this crime

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.490
on their own without any other accomplices.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:14.750
Just how many more charges are 
those girls going to add?

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.420
What are you doing, elite guards?!

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.550
Yukina...

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.670
Yukina-chan.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.280
If you have identified the 
location of the traitors,

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.410
why haven't you dispatched 
the military units?!

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:27.970
With all due respect, Renpu President,

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.180
while they may only be 
middle school students,

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:32.460
they are Toji who have 
received battle training.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.560
Not to mention they are 
in possession of okatanas.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.120
Jurisdiction is—

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.610
Then you must attack and defeat them!

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:41.060
We would like to be able to do that, too.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:44.610
Since we are being ordered 
to guard Yukari-sama,

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:45.870
we cannot make a move right now.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.220
Investigate the footage from the security 
cameras in the area where they disappeared.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.000
Yukina...

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:56.450
Both of you share the 
blame for raising traitors

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:00.370
who would dare turn their 
blades on Yukari-sama!

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:09.350
She used to be such a sweet girl.
Always calling, "Senpai, senpai," after us...

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.810
I wonder when she became so blunt.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.880
Sayaka, head to Tokyo

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.610
and defeat those cowering traitors.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.360
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:27.110
You may have lost the match,
but my opinion of you hasn't changed.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:31.620
You are the greatest Toji 
and the pride of Renpu.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.500
You aren't a prototype, like the elite guards.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:44.010
Yukari-sama, why won't 
you give me any orders?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.010
I do not recall summoning you.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.460
I came here at my own discretion.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.490
If the elite guard are unable to make a move,

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:53.580
then please leave everything to us at Renpu.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.730
Even though you are at 
her side, you are useless!

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.180
My apologies.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:20.420
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:38.870
<b>Episode 3  Innocent Sword</b>

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.990
Is this the right place?

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.090
Yeah, they said this place on the phone.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:53.010
<b>If you have any trouble, 
please contact this number.</b>

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:52.570
<i>The note that was in my bag...</i>

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:55.750
<i>It's not Mai-chan's handwriting,</i>

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.890
<i>but...</i>

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:00.160
If it's a trap, we might have to fight.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:06.320
Mai-chan gave me this letter, 
so I don't think it's a trap.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.700
Oh! There you are!

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:15.200
You two are absolutely soaked!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.650
You must be Hiyori-chan,
 which means you are Kanami-chan.

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:21.410
That's right.

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.230
My name is Onda Rui.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.450
Nice to meet you.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.530
Okay, then. Here, take this.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.550
Are you acquainted with President Hashima?

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:39.100
Yep, I'm from Minoseki.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.180
What?! So that means you're my senpai, right?

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:46.350
Right, and since I'm still on good 
terms with President Hashima,

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:49.740
she called and asked 
me to look after you two.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.570
Then that note...

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:56.700
...is from the president.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.250
It's huge!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.500
Now, come on in, you two.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.210
Okay! Thanks for having us over.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:13.910
You live by yourself?

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:19.100
Yep, isn't it great? It's spacious,
if a little far from where I work, though.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.430
If you're from Minoseki,
then that means you are also...

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.990
Yes, I'm a former Toji.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:28.610
I'm retired now. I've given back my okatana.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.570
Are you from the Sword Administration?!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.900
Not at all. Don't worry.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:38.450
I'm not involved with the Administration 
or the Origami family.

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:42.450
What sword style did you study, Rui-san?

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.460
Aren't you cold like that?

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.590
Take a bath first.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:52.450
I'll put out a change of clothes 
for you, and then we'll eat.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.760
The bathroom was really spacious, too.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.390
Could you at least try to 
be a little more suspicious?

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:05.560
Take your okatana in the bathroom with you.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:10.560
What? I don't know that I really need 
to take my okatana in there, though.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.610
The situation is what it is.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.610
I'm taking mine with me.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.000
Uh...

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.860
<i>The customary tournament between</i>

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.160
<i>the Five Schools was held by 
the Origami family of Kamakura,</i>

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.620
<i>and many students participated 
this year, as well.</i>

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.640
<i>We'll move on to the weather next.</i>

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:31.700
<i>Yes, well, today cold spring rain 
is falling in the Kanto region.</i>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:35.730
<i>However, this rain won't be around long,
 and is expected to stop tonight.</i>

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:40.030
So there hasn't been any 
announcement from the police.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:44.100
How much do you know?

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.430
I know the rough details, more or less.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:52.980
I can't believe you turned your okatana 
on the hero, Origami Yukari-sama.

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.870
Well, I won't press you 
about the subject, though.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.490
I have to get up early in the morning,
 so I'm going to bed.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.660
I'll leave a spare key on 
the table in the morning.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.620
Use it freely while I'm gone.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.500
Thank you so much.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.690
Okay, night!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.130
Good night.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:18.510
I wonder if this is okay? 
She's doing so much for us.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.010
Kanami, got a moment?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:29.770
Tell me more about what you saw 
behind Origami Yukari's back.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:33.770
Oh, okay, well...

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.230
It was only for a moment, 
so I don't really recall,

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:40.080
but it looked like it was glaring at you.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.070
Glaring... An aradama? What form was it?

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:46.210
Um...

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:48.400
You saw it, right?

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.270
I saw it, but it didn't really have a form.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.670
It seemed like it was just 
a pair of bulging eyes.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:56.800
Eyes? You're sure you're not mistaken?

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:57.850
Yeah.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.670
How can you be sure?

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:01.630
Because I'm a Toji, too.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:09.910
You said it was only for a moment.
Does that mean the aradama disappeared?

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.700
I wouldn't say that it disappeared,

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:14.780
but it did something like 
when a Toji generates utsushi.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:18.860
Kind of like it dove back 
into the netherworld.

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:23.280
I think I saw it when the head of 
the family took out her okatana.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:26.280
She took it from the underworld?

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:31.040
<i>That was Oodenta and Onimaru?</i>

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.850
<i>She took those two swords 
from the netherworld?</i>

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.970
<i>Is such a thing even possible?</i>

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:43.090
Hey, why don't we tell the others 
about her true identity and get their help?

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:44.090
No way.

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:44.960
Huh?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.530
The Sword Administration and the 
Special Religious Military Units

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:51.470
are completely under 
Origami Yukari's control.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.770
We would be crushed.

00:09:55.870 --> 00:10:00.480
You're planning on challenging the 
head of the family again, aren't you?

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:04.370
Yes, I'm going to vanquish the aradama 
pretending to be Origami Yukari.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.840
There's no other way.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.830
I don't think I'll get a second chance...

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:11.080
But as long as I'm alive, 
I just can't give up.

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:16.250
Even if you were to manage 
to face her one-on-one,

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.540
you probably wouldn't win.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:24.880
Somehow, I get the sense that her strength

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.640
is on a totally different level.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:36.160
<i>I put all the power I have 
into the fastest jin'i.</i>

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:39.900
<i>It was faster than a speeding bullet.</i>

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:42.930
<i>Even if my opponent had 
been accelerated by jin'i,</i>

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:46.590
<i>she shouldn't have been able to avoid it,
 let alone follow it with her eyes.</i>

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:50.570
<i>But she avoided it so easily!</i>

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:52.760
<i>No, wait...</i>

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:56.420
<i>Even I couldn't see her movements 
when I was accelerated.</i>

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.570
<i>But she was able to see it?</i>

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.160
Mai-chan...

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.010
If my opponent is aiming for my forearm,
 I take my kozume and draw it.

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:16.810
If they come at me in the overhead position,
 I challenge them directly.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:20.190
If they come at me in the middle position, 
I counter with the kuneriuchi attack.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.820
But if they come at me in the lower position?

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.070
You can just use the kuneriuchi 
attack for that, too.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.310
Oh, you made it. I've been waiting.

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:30.030
Man, I've been so bored.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:32.680
I've been training in 
my head this whole time.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:34.950
All right, let's do this, then!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:36.740
Sure.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.730
Huh? What's the matter?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.830
You down or something?

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:46.090
Well, I'm just really not 
sure what I should've done.

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:51.280
I see.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:55.860
Mai-chan has probably had 
a rough time because of me.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:12:01.360
But you were able to
 save another friend, right?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.740
I think what you did is 
very like you, Kanami.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:08.710
Because you are the way you are,

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.960
your friend sent you off 
without saying anything.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.450
You think so?

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.230
Yes, I do, I do!

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:16.700
Now, let's spar already!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.540
Jeez, that's all you care about.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:22.990
Well, it's the only thing 
I have to look forward to!

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:31.890
No fair...

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.440
They still haven't found Kanami.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.070
I wonder what happened to her.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.080
Mai's staying behind, too.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.900
I'm sure something will happen
 after we're back at Minoseki.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.810
Everyone's going home.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:00.420
That girl is from Renpu?

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.540
Hey, Milady Yanase!

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:04.960
Osafune's representatives?

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.920
I'm Kohagura Ellen!

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.860
And this is Kaoru.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.340
Mashiko Kaoru.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:13.540
Good work on your mission.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:17.350
I'm sure you're worried about 
your friend, but don't be sad!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.630
O-Okay...

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:20.850
I'm so glad we could meet.

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:25.310
Your dad and my parents are work partners.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.870
My father?

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.940
Hey, Ellen, hurry up.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.900
Um... are you going somewhere?

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:35.680
We are finally free!

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:38.580
We're going on vacation in Shonan!

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.040
It's perfect beach weather.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.670
Isn't that an aradama?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.920
He's my pet.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.620
Nene is Kaoru's friend.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.970
Let's go.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.200
Let's meet again sometime!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.770
See you, Mai-mai!

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.980
Mai-mai?

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:16.510
Okay, all set.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.210
What are you doing?

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:29.250
Since she's letting us stay here, I 
figured I might as well clean up, but...

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.650
This will do!

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:53.440
<b>Use as you please.
—Rui</b>

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.700
That is the end of my report.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.200
So that was a waste of time.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:03.080
Why didn't you immediately 
request back-up?

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:07.940
I decided that collection 
of the noro took priority.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:09.330
Forget about the noro!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.890
Of all the things to suppress...

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:15.220
You didn't help them escape, did you?

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.010
No!

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:23.000
No matter. Renpu will be handling the rest.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.450
You may leave.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.810
Excuse me.

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:39.740
Yanase-san.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.200
President...

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.950
You know, I understand 
how serious everything is,

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.960
but I have faith in Kanami-chan!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.130
Those two will be fine.

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:01.490
President?

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:09.190
Hey there! Is it true that you let those 
two go after finally finding them?

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.190
You're from the elite guard!

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:21.910
You're so weak!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.790
You wouldn't have been able to 
beat them in the first place.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.910
Tsubakuro-san, put your okatana away.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:31.210
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:44.650
Amazing! You're really good 
at cooking, Hiyori-chan!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:50.070
I often used to make this for my mother.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.440
I rarely get the chance to do so anymore.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.240
Your mother?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.090
Yes.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:59.390
My mother was once a Toji, too.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:02.570
She passed away last year
 after a prolonged illness.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:09.700
I see. So your mom is gone, too.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.710
They're wearing coats to cover themselves,
 but there's no mistake.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.750
Those are the Heijou and Minoseki uniforms.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.590
Go after that vehicle!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.060
I'm home!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.600
Whoa!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.380
It's like I just moved in!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:34.050
Hiyori-chan and I cleaned up as a way to 
say thanks for letting us stay here.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.670
Thank you!

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:39.690
What? Something smells good.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.030
Wow!

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:45.750
Hiyori-chan made it.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.170
Let me try it.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.290
Yep! It's delicious!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.290
I'm shocked! Hiyori-chan is so feminine.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.960
I-It's not that big a deal.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.970
Say, there's something I want 
you both to see after this.

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:07.220
We have determined the location.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.600
The apartment belongs to Onda Rui.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.130
She's a former Toji from Minoseki.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:14.350
She returned her okatana ten years ago.

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.110
She currently works at Yahata Electronics.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.710
Yahata Electronics means...

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:24.740
Yes, it is one of the companies engaged 
in the development of the S Equipment.

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:28.590
Understood. I will start the mission now.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:37.890
"Hello, Gladdy's friends."

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:41.380
<b>Hello,
Gladdy's friends.
We welcome you.</b>

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:40.930
"We welcome you"?

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:43.050
Gladdy?

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.110
Answer however you like.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:51.640
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.640
Um...

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.770
"Ally."

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:58.270
<b>You are the only two rebels.</b>

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.270
<b>You have the letter, don't you?</b>

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.650
<b>You have the letter, don't you?</b>

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:02.900
<b>Are you ready to face this?</b>

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:18.460
<b>It was just completed today!</b>

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.420
<b>Go to the following location.</b>

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.570
Kanami, go get Chidori!

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:30.180
Right!

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:31.140
You get inside!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.210
O-Okay!

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.730
You're from Renpu!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.320
<i>How is she so fast?</i>

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.620
<i>She's using jin'i for an extended period,</i>

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:58.120
<i>rather than just momentary acceleration?</i>

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.430
<i>I didn't think a person could do that.</i>

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.800
Hiyori-chan!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.870
Not yet...

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.060
Then I, too, will have...

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:24.330
to reach much, much deeper!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.410
<i>Is this an effect of the technique?</i>

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.870
<i>She doesn't seem to be able 
to generate utsushi anymore.</i>

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:41.540
No way!

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:46.460
Without her utsushi?!

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.520
<i>I'll have to cut her down.</i>

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.720
Stop!

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.910
Step aside, Hiyori-chan.

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.100
I'll be her opponent.

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:00.350
Are you prepared to kill her, then?!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:01.850
I won't kill her!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:09.280
<i>Her sword wasn't like this before.</i>

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:11.490
<i>Nothing is coming from her sword.</i>

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:16.240
You won't be able to cut anything 
with a soulless sword like that!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:21.120
She took her okatana?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.180
Do you remember me?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.130
I'm Etou Kanami. We fought each other 
in the first round of the tournament.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:32.080
That match was a lot of fun!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:36.130
Your techniques had my heart 
pounding the whole time!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:38.640
Will you spar with me again sometime?

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.210
It's a promise!

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:56.890
<i>The only choice that occurred 
to me was to kill her,</i>

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.520
<i>but Kanami...</i>

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:39.890
<b>Next Episode  The Burden of Resolution</b>
